The CUDA device function `sumReduction` in main.cu is reproduced verbatim,
and the `__global__ void cgkernel(...)` kernel in main.cu is adapted (same
this_thread_block() partition and sumReduction() call; the original's
additional tiled_partition<16> reduction and printf-only self-check are
replaced with a write to a g_odata[blockIdx.x] global output array), from:

    NVIDIA/cuda-samples
    cpp/0_Introduction/simpleCooperativeGroups/simpleCooperativeGroups.cu
    https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuda-samples/blob/master/cpp/0_Introduction/simpleCooperativeGroups/simpleCooperativeGroups.cu
